    "title": "LIVE OFFSHORE BOAT RACING: 2026 XINSURANCE Clearwater Offshore Nationals | Official Broadcast - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chad Reynolds ,\n21 hours ago The XINSURANCE Offshore Racing Series 2026 season is in Clearwater this weekend, and features big speed from giant offshore boats and more. You can watch all the racing action for free this weekend right here and if you love big boats going really fast you are going to be happy with this right here. We’ve seen these boats haul ass recently, but we’ve also seen a few fly in recent weeks. Hopefully that doesn’t happen this weekend, but we can’t wait to see the rest of the action, that’s for sure. So pull up a chair, get yourself something nice to drink, and check out all the racing action that is going on Saturday and Sunday! Read full article",
